<title>GERMANY: Degussa Q1 96/97 pre-tax profit up 20 pct.</title>
<headline>Degussa Q1 96/97 pre-tax profit up 20 pct.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>First quarter 1996/1997</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group pre-tax profit		     up  20 pct</p>
<p>    Group sales				  up  16 pct</p>
<p>Group sales excluding metal trading  up  6  pct</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German chemical, drugs and metals group is Degussa AG. The group's business year ends September 30.</p>
<p>-- Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
